<< /A << /BBox [ 105.449 436.365 489.43 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Flowchart of the study population and analytical process. A total of 812 preterm infants were assessed, of whom 123 were excluded because of missing placental histopathology, congenital or chromosomal abnormalities, multiple gestation, or incomplete clinical data. The final cohort included 689 infants, comprising 392 HCA-negative and 297 HCA-positive infants. Major neonatal outcomes, including RDS, EOS, BPD, ROP, IVH, and NEC, were evaluated. Subsequent analyses included baseline comparisons, logistic regression, gestational-age-stratified analyses, ROC analysis, calibration assessment, and internal validation.) /K 2 /Lang (en-EN) /P 183 0 R /Pg 119 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
