endobj
489 0 obj
<< /A << /BBox [ 117.468 188.334 477.411 367.427 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Three representative placental histological images illustrate maternal inflammatory response stages of histological chorioamnionitis. Stage I shows acute subchorionitis or chorionitis with neutrophilic infiltration in the subchorionic region or chorionic tissue. Stage II shows acute chorioamnionitis with extension of neutrophilic infiltration into the chorionic connective tissue and/or amnion. Stage III shows necrotizing chorioamnionitis characterized by more extensive inflammation with amniotic epithelial necrosis and associated tissue injury. The images demonstrate progressively more extensive histological inflammatory involvement across the three stages.) /K 4 /Lang (en-EN) /P 183 0 R /Pg 119 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
