<< /A << /BBox [ 116.901 443.112 477.978 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Bootstrap-corrected calibration curves compare predicted and observed probabilities of respiratory distress syndrome for Model 2, which includes gestational age and birth weight, and Model 3, which additionally includes HCA. The diagonal line represents perfect calibration. The curves for both models remain generally close to the ideal line across most predicted probability ranges, indicating acceptable agreement between predicted and observed RDS risk. Model 3 shows a calibration intercept of &minus;0.018, a calibration slope of 0.971, and a Brier score of 0.158.) /K 8 /Lang (en-EN) /P 215 0 R /Pg 138 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
